Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.00,0:02:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到的就是這個景色嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.90,0:02:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.30,0:02:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.60,0:02:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不會是來觀光的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:23.70,0:02:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 您是島上的人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:26.30,0:02:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,據導遊指南說這個島上有平家血脈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.60,0:02:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是真的 不過沒什麼大不了的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.60,0:02:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過來這裏的幾乎都是釣魚的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.80,0:02:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偶然有人來潛水 挺冷清的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是這麼個小島而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道來幹什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.10,0:02:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,外頭人沒什麼好東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.20,0:02:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.40,0:03:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}島上的女人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.40,0:03:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.60,0:03:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪裏 三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:46.60,0:03:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.50,0:04:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20}歡迎來到猿月島
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.20,0:04:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨天和前天也來過這裏  到底在等誰呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.60,0:04:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是個好人嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,誰知道呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.60,0:04:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又是那個男的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.20,0:04:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼連這種地方都會遇到他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 祐司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.70,0:04:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祐司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈 你來接我啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可我沒說過今天出院啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.70,0:04:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有話和你說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 就是那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了 來吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:56.00,0:04:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名字叫三奈 對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.10,0:05:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我也想看親熱的畫面呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.20,0:05:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有小姐一個人看 太壞了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.30,0:05:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.40,0:05:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個島明明那麼小
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.80,0:05:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了 接着找吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.40,0:05:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我沒見過啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,現在沒空
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.60,0:05:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 找別人問去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 你真是採訪專家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.10,0:05:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,開頭都這樣啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.70,0:05:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相當執着啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.00,0:05:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 湊家的三奈的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.80,0:05:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我還有事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:55.50,0:05:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近萎靡不振嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.10,0:05:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從哪學的這種詞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小島的特輯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.30,0:06:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼也請你把我們這家店寫進雜誌裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.50,0:06:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.60,0:06:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那盡情享用我們的特別推介吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.00,0:06:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特選猴冷糕 特製猴冰 奶酪猴頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纔不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.40,0:06:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼三奈是港口盡頭的湊旅館家的女兒嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.90,0:06:27.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要又多嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.60,0:06:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,說起來其實不是女兒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.10,0:06:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是藤江老闆娘的外甥女吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.90,0:06:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她的親生母親呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.60,0:06:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像叫五月 應該已經去世了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.00,0:06:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:44.30,0:06:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不妙了 怎麼辦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.00,0:06:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,交給我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.90,0:06:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是十五年前了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,投海自殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.20,0:06:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過沒找到遺體
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.70,0:07:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自殺的理由是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.50,0:07:03.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她離開過小島一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.20,0:07:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那找了男人並生下三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.80,0:07:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藤江
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果被男人拋棄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.10,0:07:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回到了島上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不離開小島就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.40,0:07:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿江你沒說錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.00,0:07:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.70,0:07:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.30,0:07:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從今以後我們在一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.40,0:07:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是打擊似乎太大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.00,0:07:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果大約兩年後 就拋下三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.30,0:07:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然後呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.70,0:07:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給我快走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.90,0:07:51.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.20,0:07:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都說了你萎靡不振啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.10,0:07:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你別老是萎靡萎靡的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.20,0:07:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個小島 話題一傳開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就再沒人會搭理他了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.60,0:08:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自作自受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,萎靡不振的時候就老老實實地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.20,0:08:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我不會放棄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.00,0:08:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 姐姐受過的那些痛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想讓三奈也嚐到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.20,0:08:25.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,懷着這想法爲她做了許多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.40,0:08:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她卻不理解
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.70,0:08:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦纔好呢 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.60,0:08:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是一樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:42.20,0:08:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,島上的人就是不願敞開心扉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.30,0:08:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幹得好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.60,0:08:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,校長先生 三奈和她姨媽感情不好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.70,0:08:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前處得很好哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們看來簡直像親母女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.50,0:09:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 湊同學初中和高中都是坐船去上學的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.80,0:09:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高中時硬是讓她退學了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.20,0:09:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.60,0:09:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,說繼承旅館不需要什麼學歷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是本人的意思嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.40,0:09:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是 我當時也覺得可憐嘗試去說服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,結果沒能說服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.80,0:09:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,湊同學也說因爲養育之恩 哭哭啼啼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.70,0:09:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.20,0:09:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下來就人所共知了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.10,0:09:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她高中的男同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.50,0:09:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打電話和三奈表白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.40,0:09:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但她姨媽怎麼也不同意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.70,0:09:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,過分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.20,0:09:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,說起來校長知道祐司這個名字嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.50,0:09:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是沼田吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.10,0:09:56.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,縣政府水產部的員工
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.20,0:09:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,說是調查小島的漁業資源
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:00.10,0:10:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在和三奈交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藤江知道此事…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.00,0:10:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎 女人的直覺吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.80,0:10:19.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼我不能和祐司交往
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.50,0:10:21.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就因爲他不是島上的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.70,0:10:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你受了傷害就太晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是姨媽你自己這麼認爲吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:27.10,0:10:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我姐姐 你的母親也是這麼想的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.70,0:10:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,離開這個島的人都會遭到不幸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.10,0:10:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不希望你這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.50,0:10:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈 你知道自己在說什麼嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.90,0:10:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三天前的這個傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,應該是偷獵者弄的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.80,0:10:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不對 是姨媽乾的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.10,0:11:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什麼根據嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.60,0:11:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:04.00,0:11:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天我聽到浴室那旁傳來呻吟時以爲是怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.30,0:11:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,當時我不知道她在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.20,0:11:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我想起了祐司你被割傷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.50,0:11:21.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈 你幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.50,0:11:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是姨媽吧 姨媽你把祐司他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.50,0:11:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.90,0:11:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要裝傻了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:28.60,0:11:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是爲了你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:36.60,0:11:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.10,0:11:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊 這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.70,0:12:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 就是這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.40,0:12:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚那個女孩就站在這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:12.30,0:12:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快離開那裏 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.60,0:12:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄通信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:24.10,0:12:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除此之外已經沒辦法了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是您早點來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.90,0:12:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就可以準備美味的海鮮了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.80,0:12:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 今晚三奈她去哪裏呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.70,0:12:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白天出去之後還沒回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.30,0:12:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過爲了那種小學時的作文的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做過很長時間的評委
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.70,0:12:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈的真是很出衆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.10,0:13:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈還將那時的獎狀掛在屋裏牆上呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.50,0:13:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她一定很開心的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼請自便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:14.00,0:13:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,預先調查一下真是對了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.40,0:13:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.80,0:13:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是看起來她不像那麼過分的人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能是太疼愛三奈了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:24.70,0:13:29.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能會有些過分之舉 但好好談談應該能解決問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.70,0:13:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真想快點和她見面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.20,0:13:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她去哪裏了呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.30,0:14:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.30,0:14:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.20,0:14:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:03.60,0:14:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:06.60,0:14:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.40,0:14:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是解開還是不解開呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難道是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.30,0:14:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是 這種東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:21.00,0:14:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太不吉利了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.20,0:14:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.20,0:14:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.40,0:14:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我們什麼都不做不知道她又會幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.30,0:14:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也許下次不只是受傷了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.20,0:14:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是從懸崖上扔掉呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.40,0:14:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還是解開繩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你們的自由
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.70,0:14:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,海岸邊嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:41.10,0:14:41.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.00,0:14:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,追吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.90,0:15:03.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了 解開吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.50,0:15:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 解了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.60,0:15:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎 怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:21.40,0:15:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是三奈小姐和祐司先生吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.20,0:15:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我 我們還什麼都沒幹呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:25.60,0:15:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稻草人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.00,0:15:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黑色稻草人怎麼樣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,您在說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,繩子還沒解開吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:33.30,0:15:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請再好好考慮一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.10,0:15:36.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還來得及
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.90,0:15:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是一時頭腦發熱解開了繩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:38.80,0:15:40.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就無法挽回了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣看來我們不能出手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩子的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:48.10,0:15:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你將會揹負無法承受的重壓
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:51.20,0:15:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣行嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:52.40,0:15:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們兩個都想幸福吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.00,0:15:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以斷言
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.30,0:15:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,無論發生什麼事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.20,0:16:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給他人帶來不幸的人絕對無法得到幸福
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:03.90,0:16:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以不要衝動
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:09.80,0:16:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,離過一次婚的我不會說錯的 相信我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.70,0:16:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:18.20,0:16:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們倆都明白了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:21.50,0:16:26.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,竟然如此關心素不相識的我們 是吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.50,0:16:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.00,0:16:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.80,0:16:33.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們能明白我很開心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎麼辦呢 祐司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.20,0:16:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,姨媽她不是能說通的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對了 乾脆我們私奔如何
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:45.90,0:16:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,私奔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,私奔啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.50,0:16:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這不太好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 還有這一手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷靜一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.70,0:16:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是私奔了你們有把握生活下去嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.30,0:17:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你姨媽她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.10,0:17:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她總有一天一定會理解的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:03.60,0:17:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到時候三個人一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:05.90,0:17:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.90,0:17:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們聽我說啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.60,0:17:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不像我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:23.30,0:17:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs20}不要衝動 珍貴的生命只有一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:25.30,0:17:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個上星期看過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.80,0:17:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好慢啊 阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.70,0:17:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是三奈小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:41.80,0:17:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.80,0:17:56.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈已經完全不聽我的話了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.80,0:18:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦好呢 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 藤江
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.30,0:18:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把三奈的事扔給你一個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.40,0:18:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.30,0:18:21.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽還活着嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.50,0:18:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我這副身子骨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:46.70,0:18:49.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是說過不提這事的嗎 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.30,0:18:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 那麼三奈由我來和她說吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.50,0:19:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.00,0:19:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:15.50,0:19:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什 什麼 這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是你的媽媽嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.80,0:19:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也看到了 媽媽我這樣子動不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.40,0:19:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哪 哪裏來的聲音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.70,0:19:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是姐姐 你的媽媽不好哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.80,0:19:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,藤江住手 不要這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.40,0:19:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼要做這麼過分的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.30,0:19:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我倒要問你呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:42.00,0:19:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都遇到那麼悽慘的事了爲什麼又想離開這座島
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.20,0:19:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這個島我討厭死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.50,0:19:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,別這樣說 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.40,0:19:53.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這不是我們出生成長的島嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.20,0:19:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要走 不要阻止我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:56.60,0:19:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼不明白啊 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:59.50,0:20:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不會放你走的 永遠在一起吧 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.20,0:20:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.80,0:20:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好過分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.80,0:20:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈 不可以責怪姨媽哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.20,0:20:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲她是真心爲我們着想才這麼做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:17.00,0:20:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好開心啊 姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:19.80,0:20:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從今以後我們三人 開開心心地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.70,0:20:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不要啊 姨媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.40,0:20:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你 不要啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.70,0:20:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老實一點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.20,0:20:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.10,0:20:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我們三人 開開心心地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.00,0:20:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在這個島上生活吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.10,0:20:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三奈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.30,0:20:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.90,0:20:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:52.80,0:20:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷靜點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:53.60,0:20:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.80,0:20:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祐司
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:58.80,0:21:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妨礙我們幸福的混帳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:12.10,0:21:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:26.30,0:21:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:37.80,0:21:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好喜歡姐姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:41.40,0:21:44.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永遠一起吧 永遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:46.80,0:21:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可悲啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.20,0:21:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把自己囚禁起來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.50,0:21:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就失去了逃脫的餘地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.50,0:21:57.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:58.60,0:22:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:17.80,0:22:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:19.90,0:22:20.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也許吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:21.30,0:22:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是發生那種事本可阻止他們的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:28.80,0:22:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我說 其實只要稍微抬下頭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:31.50,0:22:33.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就能看到這般廣闊的天空啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.60,0:22:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.30,0:23:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.00,0:23:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
