Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.80,0:24:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,名字是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:34.50,0:24:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:35.80,0:24:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼 得不到那個人的愛嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.50,0:24:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白自己不善於被愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.20,0:24:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 我不想再受到這種對待了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:49.60,0:24:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,願望是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:51.00,0:24:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把他流放到地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:54.20,0:24:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:57.50,0:25:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&\an7}下集
